          "asset": {
            "digest": "sha256:858c59ee201a7899689e597f9c367d6deff026c9232b556c52a66be23c3658a1",
            "id": 630248025,
            "name": "KernelSU-Tuner-30003-v3.0.3.zip",
            "sha256": "858c59ee201a7899689e597f9c367d6deff026c9232b556c52a66be23c3658a1",
            "size": 31324,
            "url": "https://github.com/ylh440104/KernelSU-Tuner/releases/download/v3.0.3/KernelSU-Tuner-30003-v3.0.3.zip"
          },
          "body": "Drop the zip into the KernelSU manager under Modules - Install from storage, then reboot.\n\n**If you had v3.0.2 installed, uninstall it first.** The module id changed from `ksu_tuner` to\n`KernelSU-Tuner` to match the registered id, so the manager treats them as two different modules.\n\nWhat changed in this build:\n\n- `module.prop` and `module.yaml` now use `id=KernelSU-Tuner`, matching the registered id\n- module paths follow the id, so the module now lives at `/data/adb/modules/KernelSU-Tuner`\n- the initrc file and its service names were renamed to match\n- the runtime data directory intentionally stays at `/data/adb/ksu_tuner` so existing configuration survives\n\nEverything else is unchanged from v3.0.2:\n\n- Four profiles (powersave / balanced / performance / gaming) driving CPU governor, GPU levels, IO scheduler and readahead, VM tunables, network stack, DNS and ZRAM compression\n- Adaptive switching based on temperature, screen state and charging, with hysteresis\n- Charge limiting with automatic resume\n- App Standby Bucket management with a per-app whitelist\n- Per-app profiles driven by whichever app is in the foreground\n- Custom sysfs and proc parameter editor, every change backed up first\n- Refresh rate and touch sampling tuning\n- initrc services\n- WebUI console, no external dependencies",
          "htmlUrl": "https://github.com/ylh440104/KernelSU-Tuner/releases/tag/v3.0.3",
          "immutable": true,
          "name": "v3.0.3",
          "prerelease": false,
          "prop": {
            "author": "Operit",
            "description": "内核调优全家桶：四档预设、CPU/GPU/IO/VM/网络/DNS/显示调优、智能驾驶(温度息屏充电自适应)、电池守护(充电上限)、应用待机管理、per-app 性能策略、自定义内核参数、initrc 常驻服务，全部可逆",
            "id": "KernelSU-Tuner",
            "name": "KernelSU Tuner",
            "version": "v3.0.3",
            "versionCode": "30003"
          },
